#: glossary/gdhcn.glossary.json:127
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/v0/ns/glossary/gdhcn/trust-domain
msgid "Consists of: • Defined use cases and business processes related to the utilization of Verifiable Digital Health Certificates; • the open, interoperable technical specifications that identify or define the applicable Trusted Services and Verifiable Digital Health Certificates; and • a set of policy and regulatory standards describing expected behavior of GDHCN Participants in relation to operation of the Trusted Services and utilization of Verifiable Digital Health Certificates (e.g. data minimization, privacy, scope of use)."
msgstr "包括：• 与可验证数字健康证书的使用相关的既定用例和业务流程；• 确定或定义适用的可信服务和可验证数字健康证书的开放、可互操作技术规范；以及 • 一套政策和监管标准，描述 GDHCN 参与方在运营可信服务和使用可验证数字健康证书方面的预期行为（例如数据最小化、隐私、使用范围）。"

