#: glossary/gdhcn.glossary.json:48
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/v0/ns/glossary/gdhcn/gdhcn-trust-network
msgid "The GDHCN Trust Network is a Trust Network comprised of the GDHCN Secretariat and GDHCN Participants. The GDHCN Trust Network operationalizes Trust Domains through a Trust Network Gateway by enabling bilateral verification and utilization of Verifiable Digital Health Certificates and the utilization of Trusted Services by GDHCN Participants."
msgstr "GDHCN 信任网络是由 GDHCN 秘书处和 GDHCN 参与方组成的信任网络。GDHCN 信任网络通过信任网络网关使信任域投入运行，使 GDHCN 参与方能够双边验证和使用可验证数字健康证书，并使用可信服务。"

#: glossary/gdhcn.glossary.json:120
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/v0/ns/glossary/gdhcn/technical-representative
msgid "The individual designated by a GDHCN Participant as having the primary overall responsibility for the security, technical matters and systems infrastructure of this GDHCN Participant for the applicable Trust Domain, including ensuring compliance with technical specifications."
msgstr "由 GDHCN 参与方指定的个人，就适用的信任域对该 GDHCN 参与方的安全、技术事务和系统基础设施负有首要的总体责任，包括确保遵守技术规范。"

#: glossary/gdhcn.glossary.json:76
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/v0/ns/glossary/gdhcn/legal-representative
msgid "The individual designated by a GDHCN Participant as having the primary responsibility for reviewing the requirements related to a Trust Domain on behalf of this GDHCN Participant. This person should be someone that the GDHCN Secretariat can consult in relation to any legal or policy issues that may arise, such as changes to this document or changes to one of its Annexes that defines a Trust Domain."
msgstr "由 GDHCN 参与方指定的个人，代表该 GDHCN 参与方对与信任域相关的要求负有首要审查责任。此人应是 GDHCN 秘书处在可能出现的任何法律或政策问题上可以咨询的人，例如本文件的变更或其定义某一信任域的附件之一的变更。"

#: glossary/gdhcn.glossary.json:12
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/v0/ns/glossary/gdhcn/business-owner-representative
msgid "The individual identified by a GDHCN Participant as having the primary business and programmatic responsibility for the GDHCN Participant for the implementation of the use cases covered by a Trust Domain."
msgstr "由 GDHCN 参与方确定的个人，就信任域所涵盖用例的实施，代表该 GDHCN 参与方负有首要的业务和规划责任。"

#: glossary/gdhcn.glossary.json:69
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/v0/ns/glossary/gdhcn/key-master-representative
msgid "The individual identified by a GDHCN Participant as having the primary responsibility for the management of the Public Key Infrastructure, including the generation of any needed public-private key pairs, and the configuration and management of the connections between the GDHCN Participant’s Public Key Infrastructure and the GDHCN Trust Network Gateway."
msgstr "由 GDHCN 参与方确定的个人，对公钥基础设施的管理负有首要责任，包括生成所需的公私密钥对，以及配置和管理该 GDHCN 参与方的公钥基础设施与 GDHCN 信任网络网关之间的连接。"

#: glossary/gdhcn.glossary.json:141
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/v0/ns/glossary/gdhcn/trust-network-gateway
msgid "The open-source software and its IT operational infrastructure, utilizing open standards, for a Public Key Infrastructure and metadata management services which is used to operationalize one or more Trust Domains."
msgstr "采用开放标准、用于公钥基础设施和元数据管理服务的开源软件及其 IT 运营基础设施，用于使一个或多个信任域投入运行。"

#: glossary/gdhcn.glossary.json:26
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/v0/ns/glossary/gdhcn/encryption-key-certificate-governance
msgid "The process and technical specifications regarding the management and use of encryption keys for Verifiable Digital Health Certificates, Public Key Infrastructure, and for securing connections with Trusted Services and the Trust Network Gateway."
msgstr "有关加密密钥管理和使用的流程与技术规范，涉及可验证数字健康证书、公钥基础设施，以及与可信服务和信任网络网关之间连接的安全保障。"

#: glossary/gdhcn.glossary.json:90
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/v0/ns/glossary/gdhcn/onboarding-process
msgid "The processes required for an Eligible GDHCN Participant to join the GDHCN Trust Network. At the successful conclusion of the Onboarding Process, the Eligible GDHCN Participant shall be considered a GDHCN Participant. Sometimes simply referred to as “Onboarding”."
msgstr "合格 GDHCN 参与方加入 GDHCN 信任网络所需的各项流程。入网流程顺利完成后，该合格 GDHCN 参与方应被视为 GDHCN 参与方。有时简称为“入网”。"

#: glossary/gdhcn.glossary.json:41
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/v0/ns/glossary/gdhcn/gdhcn-secretariat
msgid "The WHO Secretariat serves as the operational and management leadership of the GDHCN, and in this role, is referred to as the GDHCN Secretariat."
msgstr "世卫组织（WHO）秘书处担任 GDHCN 的运营和管理领导机构，以此身份称为 GDHCN 秘书处。"

